{
  "brokers": [
    {
      "name": "Local Mosquitto",
      "host": "mosquitto",
      "port": 1883,
      "is_enabled": true
    }
  ],
  "settings": {
    "retention_period_hours": 24,
    "save_sys_topics": false
  },
  "dashboards": [
    {
      "id": "dev-showcase",
      "name": "Dev Showcase",
      "panels": [
        {
          "title": "🧪 Developer Showcase",
          "panel_type": "text",
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0,
          "w": 12,
          "h": 2,
          "config_json": {
            "markdown": "# 🧪 Developer Showcase Dashboard\n\nComprehensive test suite featuring all **9 panel types** and configurations:\n- **Monitors**: Radial / Bar / Value Gauges, Topic Throughput Stats, Streaming Live Logs\n- **Controls**: Instant & Confirmation Action Buttons, Dynamic Input, Automated Cron\n- **Visuals**: Separator Dividers, Rich Markdown, Architecture Media Cards"
          }
        },
        {
          "title": "Section Divider",
          "panel_type": "separator",
          "x": 0,
          "y": 2,
          "w": 12,
          "h": 1,
          "config_json": {
            "orientation": "horizontal",
            "thickness": 2,
            "color": "#9ca3af"
          }
        },
        {
          "title": "Temperature (Radial Dial)",
          "panel_type": "gauge",
          "x": 0,
          "y": 3,
          "w": 3,
          "h": 3,
          "config_json": {
            "topic": "sensors/living-room/temperature",
            "valueKey": "value",
            "unit": "°C",
            "min": 0,
            "max": 50,
            "colorScheme": "auto",
            "gaugeType": "radial"
          }
        },
        {
          "title": "Humidity (Progress Bar)",
          "panel_type": "gauge",
          "x": 3,
          "y": 3,
          "w": 3,
          "h": 3,
          "config_json": {
            "topic": "sensors/living-room/humidity",
            "valueKey": "value",
            "unit": "%",
            "min": 0,
            "max": 100,
            "colorScheme": "auto",
            "gaugeType": "bar"
          }
        },
        {
          "title": "Motion Detector (Value Card)",
          "panel_type": "gauge",
          "x": 6,
          "y": 3,
          "w": 3,
          "h": 3,
          "config_json": {
            "topic": "sensors/living-room/motion",
            "valueKey": "value",
            "gaugeType": "value"
          }
        },
        {
          "title": "Sensor Metrics & Rate",
          "panel_type": "stats",
          "x": 9,
          "y": 3,
          "w": 3,
          "h": 3,
          "config_json": {
            "topic": "sensors/#",
            "defaultRange": 60,
            "showStatTiles": true,
            "showChart": true,
            "showTopicBreakdown": true
          }
        },
        {
          "title": "Section Divider",
          "panel_type": "separator",
          "x": 0,
          "y": 6,
          "w": 12,
          "h": 1,
          "config_json": {
            "orientation": "horizontal",
            "thickness": 2,
            "color": "#9ca3af"
          }
        },
        {
          "title": "Start Node (Action Button)",
          "panel_type": "button",
          "x": 0,
          "y": 7,
          "w": 3,
          "h": 3,
          "config_json": {
            "label": "Start Node",
            "topic": "device/1/cmd",
            "payload": "START",
            "qos": 1,
            "retain": false
          }
        },
        {
          "title": "Stop Node (Action Button)",
          "panel_type": "button",
          "x": 3,
          "y": 7,
          "w": 3,
          "h": 3,
          "config_json": {
            "label": "Stop Node",
            "topic": "device/1/cmd",
            "payload": "STOP",
            "qos": 1,
            "retain": false
          }
        },
        {
          "title": "Quick Boost (Custom Payload)",
          "panel_type": "button",
          "x": 6,
          "y": 7,
          "w": 3,
          "h": 3,
          "config_json": {
            "label": "Boost Fan",
            "topic": "sensors/bathroom/humidity",
            "payload": "{\"action\": \"boost\", \"speed\": 100}",
            "qos": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "title": "Emergency Cut (Confirmed)",
          "panel_type": "button",
          "x": 9,
          "y": 7,
          "w": 3,
          "h": 3,
          "config_json": {
            "label": "Emergency Stop",
            "topic": "device/1/cmd",
            "payload": "{\"action\": \"emergency_stop\"}",
            "qos": 1,
            "requireConfirm": true
          }
        },
        {
          "title": "Section Divider",
          "panel_type": "separator",
          "x": 0,
          "y": 10,
          "w": 12,
          "h": 1,
          "config_json": {
            "orientation": "horizontal",
            "thickness": 2,
            "color": "#9ca3af"
          }
        },
        {
          "title": "Custom Command Publisher",
          "panel_type": "input",
          "x": 0,
          "y": 11,
          "w": 4,
          "h": 3,
          "config_json": {
            "topic": "test/command",
            "qos": 0,
            "retain": false
          }
        },
        {
          "title": "Heartbeat Scheduler",
          "panel_type": "cron",
          "x": 4,
          "y": 11,
          "w": 4,
          "h": 3,
          "config_json": {
            "cron_expr": "* * * * *",
            "topic": "test/heartbeat",
            "payload": "{\"status\": \"healthy\"}",
            "enabled": true
          }
        },
        {
          "title": "Live IoT & Test Feed",
          "panel_type": "log",
          "x": 8,
          "y": 11,
          "w": 4,
          "h": 3,
          "config_json": {
            "topics": "sensors/#, test/#",
            "maxMessages": 200,
            "dateFormat": "full",
            "showQos": true,
            "showRetained": true
          }
        },
        {
          "title": "Section Divider",
          "panel_type": "separator",
          "x": 0,
          "y": 14,
          "w": 12,
          "h": 1,
          "config_json": {
            "orientation": "horizontal",
            "thickness": 2,
            "color": "#9ca3af"
          }
        },
        {
          "title": "Architecture Blueprint",
          "panel_type": "image",
          "x": 0,
          "y": 15,
          "w": 6,
          "h": 3,
          "config_json": {
            "src": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558494949-ef010cbdcc31?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80"
          }
        },
        {
          "title": "System Notes & Guide",
          "panel_type": "text",
          "x": 6,
          "y": 15,
          "w": 6,
          "h": 3,
          "config_json": {
            "markdown": "### 🛠️ Developer Tips & Controls\n\n- **Drag & Resize**: Click **Edit: ON** in the header to reorder or resize panels.\n- **Topic Explorer**: Use the search icon in any config modal to browse topics.\n- **QoS & Retain**: Configure per-panel Quality of Service and retained flags.\n- **Multiple Brokers**: Easily switch brokers per panel."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
